{"title":"China fact of the day","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/912767777/0/marginalrevolution~China-fact-of-the-day.html","date":1739301339000,"content":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>Marriages in China plunged by a fifth to the lowest level on record last year, a setback to efforts by the government to reverse a demographic crisis threatening the world’s second-biggest economy.</p>\r\n<p>The number of marriage registrations fell to 6.1 million, according to statistics <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.mca.gov.cn/mzsj/tjsj/2024/2024dssjdtjsj.htm\" target=\"_blank\">released</a> by China’s Ministry of Civil Affairs on Saturday, after a post-pandemic increase to nearly 7.7 million in 2023. The tally for last year marks the fewest marriages since public records began in 1986 and is less than half the peak reached in 2013.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-02-10/china-marriages-fall-to-record-low-as-demographic-crisis-deepens?srnd=homepage-americas&amp;sref=htOHjx5Y\" target=\"_blank\">more from Bloomberg News</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html\">China fact of the day</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/912767777/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/912767777/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/912767777/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/912767777/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/912767777/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/912767777/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comment-160873805\">In reply to MT.   My wife thought she had done pretty well when ...</a> <i>by bazza</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comment-160873802\">In reply to Whippersnapper!.   People do retire in their 50s.</a> <i>by bazza</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comment-160873801\">In reply to The Original D.   About time someone pointed out ...</a> <i>by bazza</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comment-160873800\">In reply to Sure.   I think marriage can be a wonderful ...</a> <i>by Pillow Lasers</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/02/china-fact-of-the-day-77.html#comment-160873798\">In reply to ElsieT.   Are you pro-death?</a> <i>by Jon B</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/margin